From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: deichor <deichors@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 7 Aug 2026 06:57:04 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: carry secure chat across a seamless backend switch

Port of the Paper fork's patch, which applied unchanged. A no-Respawn
switch strands the client's chat state, because Login is the only thing
that resets it; without this a premium player is kicked with
chat_validation_failed about a second after crossing a shard boundary.
Also carries the signed-chat relay so a message can cross backends and
still verify on the receiving client.

