+    /**
+     * The client keeps acknowledging messages it saw on the source backend, and its tracker is only
+     * cleared by a Login packet. A destination that starts with an empty window rejects the very
+     * first acknowledgement — "Advanced last seen window by N messages, but expected at most 0" —
+     * and kicks the player with {@code chat_validation_failed} about a second after the switch,
+     * without them having typed anything.
+     */
